  "description": "The ZEAL LT7 is a smart, efficient commuter e-bike designed to elevate your everyday ride. Its 500W rear motor (peak 750W) and 65Nm of torque provide enough power for city hills and quick takeoffs, while the torque sensor ensures a natural and efficient pedal assist experience.\nPowered by a 48V 13Ah battery, the LT7 gives riders up to 70 miles on pedal assist and 38 miles on throttle—ideal for work commutes or spontaneous weekend rides.\nA Shimano 7-speed drivetrain paired with front suspension offers balanced versatility, and LOGAN hydraulic disc brakes deliver strong and responsive stopping. The adjustable stem and padded saddle let you fine-tune your riding position for all-day comfort.\nDesigned for riders who value performance without complexity, the LT7 includes an intuitive LCD display, integrated lighting, and a lightweight yet sturdy frame.",
